TITLE:: FxParamView
summary:: the base of an effect's display
categories:: Libraries>FxKit
related:: Classes/FxParamUnit, Classes/FxParamPanel, Classes/ParaEQSpectrum

DESCRIPTION::
One UserView that draws the effect and is usually a way of playing it too. A subclass writes code::prDraw::, using code::bw:: and code::bh:: for its size, and whichever of code::prMouseDown::, code::prMouseMove::, code::prMouseUp::, code::prWheel:: and code::hint:: it wants. The panel refreshes it on every change, and on every meter reply while it is on screen. One answering true to code::*wantsSpectrum:: can call code::prDrawSpectrum::.

